UID:10081673-1784775600-1784861999@livemusicasheville.com
SUMMARY:COMING Saturday August 15 | Dirty Logic: A Steely Dan Tribute
DESCRIPTION:Saturday\, August 15 | Show: 7:30 pm | Outdoor Stage | $36.15 adv. Event Details and Tickets \nDirty Logic will be performing at Pisgah Brewing Company on Friday\, August 15 for a full evening of Steely Dan classics—set against the backdrop of one of Western North Carolina’s favorite outdoor stages. Bring a lawn chair\, settle in\, and make an evening of it! \n\nThis 11-piece band draws from some of Asheville’s finest musicians\, united by a shared love and deep reverence for the Steely Dan songbook. What you’ll hear is more than faithful reproduction—it’s a heartfelt celebration of one of the most sophisticated and enduring catalogs in American music. The iconic hits\, the deep cuts\, the intricate solos\, and the funkier live arrangements that longtime fans treasure. \n\n\nEvery show is both a careful honoring of the studio recordings and a living\, breathing musical experience—the kind that reminds you why this music has stayed with people for decades. \n\n\n\nThe setlist draws from Aja\, Gaucho\, The Royal Scam\, Pretzel Logic\, Can’t Buy a Thrill\, Countdown to Ecstasy\, Katy Lied\, and the FM soundtrack. \n\n  \nFounded in 2005\, Pisgah is known for producing some of the most sought after craft ales in Western North Carolina. Pisgah Brewing Company currently operates the new indoor taproom & deli\, with live music several days a week\, plus an open air outdoor bar in the summer and fall months. Check out our upcoming schedule at pisgahbrewing.com/events
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/coming-saturday-august-15-dirty-logic-a-steely-dan-tribute/2026-07-23/
LOCATION:Pisgah Brewing Company Black Mountain\, 2948 US-70\, Black Mountain\, NC\, 28711
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Black Mountain,Live Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://livemusicasheville.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/685171639_1442428554577983_9184397236339944120_n-e1777565066509.jpg
GEO:35.6068069;-82.3568213
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=Pisgah Brewing Company Black Mountain 2948 US-70 Black Mountain NC 28711;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=2948 US-70:geo:-82.3568213,35.6068069
END:VEVENT
