SUMMARY:Thursday Night Funk!
DESCRIPTION:Join us every Thursday for Thursday Night Funk\, where Asheville’s best musicians come together for a high-energy\, ever-changing jam packed with deep grooves\, killer solos\, and plenty of surprises. No two nights are ever the same\, so you never know who might jump on stage. \nThis week we’re excited to welcome special guest Simon Thomas George\, along with your hosts Ben Bjorlie\, Josh Blake\, Jacob Rodriguez\, Kyle Snuffer\, and Claude Coleman Jr. Also on the scene\, DJ Meow Meow! \nDoors open at 7PM. Grab a drink\, bring your friends\, and settle in for one of Asheville’s favorite weekly music traditions. \nEvery Thursday.\nBarley’s Street Level\n42 Biltmore Ave • Downtown Asheville\n21+; $10 suggested donation to support local live music \nBarley’s – Asheville’s Original Downtown Gathering Place Since 1994\, serving amazing pizza\, wings\, salads & more with two full bars\, pool tables\, darts\, shuffleboard\, and an experienced & friendly staff. \nLive Music. DJs. Craft Beer. Cocktails. Pizza. Late Nights. Open Thursday-Monday with late night food. barleystaproom.com \n*21+ only; valid ID required
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/thursday-night-funk-2/
LOCATION:Barley’s Downtown\, 42 Biltmore Ave\, Asheville\, North Carolina\, 28801
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Live Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://livemusicasheville.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Screenshot-2026-07-22-213408-e1784770502886.png
GEO:35.5932923;-82.5509832
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=Barley’s Downtown 42 Biltmore Ave Asheville North Carolina 28801;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=42 Biltmore Ave:geo:-82.5509832,35.5932923
END:VEVENT
