SUMMARY:COMING JULY 28th | Steel Pulse
DESCRIPTION:Tuesday\, July 28  |  6:30PM – 10 PM  |  From $55.07 Event Details and Tickets\n\nCome see Steel Pulse live on the outdoor stage as part of the French Broad River Brewery Summer Concert Series!\n\nBearing witness to the accelerating negativity of global affairs\, British reggae powerhouse Steel Pulse exemplify musical vengeance to halt the disarray of humanity. Hailing from Birmingham\, England\, Steel Pulse emerged in 1975 with music that provokes thought toward global unification. Songs like “Chant a Psalm” have landed on Rolling Stone’s Top 200 Best Songs list of the 1980s\, and the six-time Grammy nominated group won the Grammy Award for Best Reggae Album for Babylon the Bandit. Lead singer and guitarist\, David Hinds’ creativity\, human persona\, and visionary views are revealed through inspiring compositions that capture the effects of the African Diaspora. As reggae revolutionaries\, Steel Pulse is revered by the younger generation of artists and remains a powerhouse on stages around the globe.\n  \nFrench Broad River Brewery is more than just a place to enjoy a drink—it’s a community hub where great beer\, delicious pizza\, live music\, and good times come together. Just minutes from the Biltmore Estate & Downtown\, our taproom is a gathering spot for locals and visitors alike. We regularly host live music and entertainment in our taproom\, making French Broad River Brewery a lively hub of local activity. From bluegrass to reggae\, there’s always something happening. Check out our Events Page to see what’s coming up next! \nNo brewery experience is complete without great food. That’s why we offer French Broad River Pizza\, serving up hot\, hand-tossed pizzas made to order. Whether you’re here for a quick slice or a full meal\, our pizza perfectly complements our craft beers and the lively atmosphere of our taproom. frenchbroadbrewery.com/pizza
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/coming-july-28th-steel-pulse/2026-07-24/
LOCATION:French Broad River Brewery\, 101 Fairview Rd\, Asheville\, NC\, United States
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Live Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://livemusicasheville.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/657379444_18574613563016085_5004447326257008683_n-e1776445455382.jpg
GEO:35.5662722;-82.5374054
